      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient with ischaemic heart disease and anaemia presenting for surgery underwent ambulatory electrocardiographic monitoring. Significant episodes of silent myocardial ischaemia were demonstrated. Following preoperative correction of the anaemia, ischaemia was not detected."},
